  "script": {
    "word_count": 218,
    "est_duration_s": 87.2,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": "seg-01",
        "chapter_id": "ch-01",
        "text": "This is Palm Jumeirah, United Arab Emirates, seen from space by Landsat satellites, one summer at a time from 1987 to 2026.",
        "year_from": 1987,
        "year_to": 2001,
        "claim_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-02",
        "chapter_id": "ch-02",
        "text": "Between 2002 and 2019, about a fifth of the area turned from water to land, mostly in the northeast. In all, about 830 hectares changed. Part of it may come from switching Landsat satellites. Records show: Between 2002 and 2008, the artificial archipelago of Palm Jumeirah was constructed, evolving from early stages to a structure featuring seventeen sandy fronds. In 2002, water covered about 92 percent of the view; by 2019, about 72 percent. The change held for eight summers in the record. Compare the 2002 and 2019 frames to see it.",
        "year_from": 2002,
        "year_to": 2006,
        "claim_ids": [
          "cl-01"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-03",
        "chapter_id": "ch-03",
        "text": "Between 2007 and 2023, the land across the area turned greener on average, mostly in the northeast. In all, about 350 hectares changed. One report says: Extensive landscaping efforts on Palm Jumeirah involved planting thousands of trees, shrubs, and flowers, which transformed the area into a lush oasis. One report also says: A new park covering more than 10 hectares was opened on Palm Jumeirah, featuring over 60 species of indigenous trees and plants. The change held for four summers in the record. Compare the 2007 and 2023 frames to see it.",
        "year_from": 2007,
        "year_to": 2023,
        "claim_ids": [
          "cl-02",
          "cl-03"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-04",
        "chapter_id": "ch-04",
        "text": "That is how Palm Jumeirah, United Arab Emirates has changed since 1987.",
        "year_from": 2024,
        "year_to": 2026,
        "claim_ids": []
      }
    ]
